  Q9 ranking:
  1. Run the digest gate (four pins) before tagging 1.3.1 — the only claim in the CHANGELOG without evidence behind it.
  2. Close or consciously accept the loader-path T1 gap (F1): either call frameReason in the OpenMS patch's Frames.T1 loop (3 lines, same header) or state in the README that -dnoise:ms1 false + openms detector converts frames outside the checked span. Cheapest fix, removes the only path where 1.3.1 converts outside the checked domain.
